% core.mcrl2 -- a lock shared by three clients, the classic mutual exclusion example,
% written as one linear process in naima-codegen's form: every summand is
%   condition -> c_<label>(args) . Core(assignments)
% and follows a tag line, %@input for what the environment says, %@order <level> for
